    '<div class="aw-key"><span class="aw-chip aw-safe">a_w &lt; 0.60 — microbes can’t grow</span><span class="aw-chip aw-mid">0.60–0.85 — some can</span><span class="aw-chip aw-high">&gt; 0.85 — easy to spoil</span></div>';
